This is an example post, not a product announcement. It exists so the Insights pages are not empty, and so editors can see the file Keystatic writes.

A post is a Markdown file in `content/posts`. The file name is the address, so this page is `/insights/example-how-an-insight-is-written`.

The video below is the same How it works demo already on the site. Replace `videoUrl` with another YouTube or Vimeo link, or with a file in `public/videos`, for example `/videos/genwealth-custodians.mp4`.

You can edit this in Keystatic while `bun run dev` is running, at `/keystatic`, or change the file by hand. After a commit, Cloudflare Pages rebuilds the static site.
